[{"title":"酒有和劲","author":"罗大经","text":"小槽真珠太森严，兵厨玉友专甘醇。\n两家风味欠商略，偏刚偏柔俱可怜。\n使君袖有转物手，鸬鹚杓中平等分。\n更凭石髓媒妁之，混融并作一家春。\n季良不用笑伯高，张竦何必讥陈遵。\n时中便是尼父圣，孤竹柳下成一人。\n平虽有智难独任，勃也未可嫌少文。\n黄龙丙魏要兼用，姚宋相济成开元。\n试将此酒反观我，胸中问学当日新。\n更将此酒达观国，宇宙皆可归经纶。\n书生触处便饶舌，以一贯万如斲轮。\n使君闻此却绝倒，罚以太白眠金尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30978,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陪桂林伯赵季仁游桂林暗洞列炬数百随以鼓吹市人从之者以千计巳而入申而出入自曾公岩出于栖霞洞入若深夜出乃白昼恍如隔宿异世季仁索余赋诗纪之","author":"罗大经","text":"瑰奇恣搜讨，贝阙青瑶房。\n方隘疑永巷，俄敞如华堂。\n玉桥巧横溪，琼户正当窗。\n仙佛肖彷佛，钟鼓铿击撞。\n赑赑左顾龟，狺狺欲吠庬。\n丹灶俨亡恙，芝田蔼生香。\n搏噬千怪聚，绚烂五色光。\n更无一尘涴，但觉六月凉。\n玲珑穿数路，屈曲通三湘。\n神鬼工剜刻，乾坤真混茫。\n入如夜漆暗，出乃日珠光。\n隔世疑恍惚，异境难揣量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30979,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"罗大经","text":"臭袜终须来塞口，枉收八百斛胡椒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30980,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"罗大经","text":"日占出海时，月验仰瓦体。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30981,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿林仲乔尊人","author":"罗子衎","text":"过了元宵八日间，琴堂歌舞献慈颜。\n七闽山水须眉秀，三楚云烟杖屦闲。\n痴绝不妨公事了，欢浓莫于酒杯悭。\n明年今日迎新霈，锦轴荣封鬓未斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30982,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三登乐 庆黄守正月廿二","author":"罗子衎","text":"过了元宵，见七叶蓂又飞。\n恰今朝、昴宿降瑞。\n初度果生贤，尽道丰姿绝异。\n翰林人物，云霄富贵。\n自栖鸾展骥。\n迤逦黄堂，每登要路无留滞。\n暂归来，访松菊，趣装行用济。\n增崇福禄，寿延千百岁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30983,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝句 其七","author":"罗公升","text":"本是山林物，中间一念差。\n稻粱今懒种，况乃种桃花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30984,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝句 其四","author":"罗公升","text":"群盗田夫耳，兵疲万骨枯。\n千年干羽事，只道圣人迂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30985,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝句 其三","author":"罗公升","text":"贾生空痛哭，汉吏孰分忧。\n谩倚天为命，天命不自由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30986,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝句 其一","author":"罗公升","text":"吟昔从军瘦，生涯出仕空。\n山中破茅屋，日日是秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30987,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝句 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"天岂私贫我，看书每自疑。\n寸心即知己，不用世人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30988,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝句 其六","author":"罗公升","text":"橐重驴鸣苦，村空鬼哭悲。\n黄华存大体，不肯问狐狸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30989,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七绝句 其五","author":"罗公升","text":"水旱关何事，兵凶孰汝怜。\n但寻师辟谷，莫误客求田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30990,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发湖州 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"彭蠡太湖三十驿，澄江如练忆玄晖。\n他年云海相逢处，还取苕溪一叶飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30991,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发湖州 其一","author":"罗公升","text":"秋色频于客鬓加，归期犹自叹无涯。\n行缠剩欠江湖债，未著袈裟已出家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30992,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戍妇","author":"罗公升","text":"夫戍关西妾在东，东西何处望相从。\n只应两处秋宵梦，万一关头得暂逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30993,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬州","author":"罗公升","text":"琼姬羽化归天去，花后香销扫地空。\n要觅扬州旧风物，夕阳禅智立秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30994,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"胡羯宁知分，中原欲并驱。\n设兵生建武，堪与赤眉俱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30995,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏 其一","author":"罗公升","text":"帝历千年统，神州百代居。\n但看今日事，莫信古人书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30996,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵槐侄送花","author":"罗公升","text":"尘欺双鬓少，春寄一枝多。\n为报花神道，晴天载酒过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30997,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白沟河乃旧日南北分界之地","author":"罗公升","text":"万里封疆到白沟，祖宗犹拟复幽州。\n他年海岛无归处，谁解捐躯为国谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30998,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观猎","author":"罗公升","text":"诡御羞禽获，随车忍兽呼。\n为驱须桀纣，竞逐欠陈吾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":30999,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观潮 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"仆越吞荆志未酬，此身生死只吴钩。\n今人自有长驱策，不待君王赐属镂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31000,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观潮 其一","author":"罗公升","text":"白马扬波信有神，了知忠愤不缘身。\n潮头却向西陵出，犹为君王击越人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31001,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"罗公升","text":"早知色外本无身，不踏阎浮末世尘。\n说与达多何用许，如来元自等冤亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31002,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵岩寺 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"马嵬锦袜战尘中，辱颈空馀颈血红。\n却是西施偏命好，国亡犹得嫁朱公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31003,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵岩寺 其一","author":"罗公升","text":"石门木老势槎牙，曾见吴娃拥翠华。\n底事秦宫与唐苑，百年多属梵王家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31004,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和宫怨","author":"罗公升","text":"竹叶垂黄雨露偏，羞缘买赋费金钱。\n有缘会有承恩日，莫遣蛾眉减去年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31005,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金陵","author":"罗公升","text":"江左诸人未易轻，驰驱犹欲致中兴。\n后人只说清谈误，并与清谈已不能。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31006,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客楼次韵单中怨","author":"罗公升","text":"白刃交飞楼下楼，却教骑马逐吴钩。\n江南此去无消息，只听鸿声认妾愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31007,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日夫人阁","author":"罗公升","text":"君王著意在经帷，无复琼林宴赏时。\n从此六宫休斗草，碧纱窗下读毛诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31008,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日皇后阁","author":"罗公升","text":"坤元布气本无私，载物功深世不知。\n天上春回椒殿暖，春风才入万年枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31009,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日皇帝阁 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"太液池边数树红，年年先得占春风。\n那知万物含仁义，都在君王一笑中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31010,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"罗公升","text":"人在幽窗柳在阑，楼头杜宇一声残。\n梦魂惊断梨花月，寂寞五更风雨寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31011,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"相国寺","author":"罗公升","text":"白璧犹书唐岁月，都城更记旧朝廷。\n如何六代明天子，不及缁衣独有灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31012,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日有感","author":"罗公升","text":"桂花无主亦清秋，荞麦为谁先白头。\n萤不照身常隐见，鸥燕求世自沈浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31013,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其二","author":"罗公升","text":"空庭下梧叶，欲静闻疏雨。\n幽怀耿无寐，邻客终夜语。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31014,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀 其一","author":"罗公升","text":"钱塘八月潮，胜绝闻古今。\n吴儿识潮耳，不识潮中心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31015,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送归使绝句 其七","author":"罗公升","text":"人问我何之，我以此诗对。\n云飞百川流，只在天地内。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31016,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送归使绝句 其六","author":"罗公升","text":"手植东皋松，勿遣樵牧经。\n他时化鹤归，要斲千年苓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31017,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送归使绝句 其五","author":"罗公升","text":"鱼鳖甘贻祸，鸡豚饱自焚。\n莫云鸥鹭宿，馋口不饶君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31018,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送归使绝句 其四","author":"罗公升","text":"梁楚连天阔，江湖接海浮。\n故人相忆夜，风雨定何州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31019,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送归使绝句 其三","author":"罗公升","text":"百年诗礼训，惟彝仲容贤。\n慎勿如痴叔，膏明适自煎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"